4,0,,status,Shunichi,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""VILLAGER"",""alive"":true}"
5,0,1,talk,Shunichi,,"Well, here we are. A classic game of deception. Since it's Day 0, we have no information yet, but I'm curious to see who among you starts acting nervous first. Any opening thoughts?","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,George,,"It is a bit early to judge nerves, Shunichi. I believe it is best to observe everyone's behavior calmly for now. Let us see how the conversation unfolds naturally.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Yumi,,"I agree with George! Let's all try to get along and be honest. I'm a little nervous, but I'll do my best to help us find the werewolf! Does anyone have a strategy?","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Takumi,,"I don't need a strategy to find a liar! I'll just watch everyone closely. If anyone starts acting weird or trying to hide something, I'll be the first one to call them out!","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Jonathan,,"It is a pleasure to be here with you all. I believe Takumi's enthusiasm is admirable, though I prefer a quieter approach. Let us simply listen to one another and see what the truth reveals.","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Shunichi,,"A quiet approach, huh? That sounds like a perfect cover for someone trying to blend into the background. @Jonathan, you're being awfully serene. Is that natural, or are you just playing the part?","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,George,,"Now, now, Shunichi. Let us not jump to conclusions so quickly. Jonathan's demeanor is consistent with his nature. It is far too early to label silence as a cover.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""Shunichi"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Yumi,,"@Shunichi, please don't be so mean! I think Jonathan is just being polite. We should try to be supportive of each other so we can work together to win! Right, everyone?","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Shunichi"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Takumi,,"@Yumi, you're too nice! Being supportive won't find the werewolf. @Shunichi is right to be suspicious. If someone is too quiet, they're probably hiding something. I'm not letting anyone slip away!","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Shunichi, @Takumi, I understand your suspicion. However, silence is not always a mask; sometimes it is simply a way to listen more clearly. I am happy to answer any questions you may have.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Shunichi"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Shunichi,,"Fair enough, Jonathan. But remember, the most dangerous people are often the ones who are ""happy to answer any questions."" It makes you seem transparent, which is a classic tactic. I'll be watching.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,George,,"It seems we are spending a great deal of energy on suspicions before the first night has even passed. Let us maintain our composure. Constant accusations will only create confusion, which is exactly what a werewolf would want.","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Yumi,,"I think George is right! If we start fighting now, we'll just get confused. Let's try to stay positive and trust each other for a little bit. We can still be careful without being mean!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Takumi,,"I'm not fighting, I'm just being honest! @George, being too calm can be a trick too. I'm going to keep my eyes on everyone, especially the ones trying to make us all ""get along.""","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Jonathan,,"I appreciate your vigilance, Takumi. It is a necessary part of this game. I will continue to observe and listen, hoping that our collective reasoning leads us to the truth.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Shunichi,,"It seems we've established our roles: George and Yumi are the peacemakers, Takumi is the watchdog, and Jonathan is the enigma. I'll play the skeptic. Let's see who breaks character first tomorrow.","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""George"",""Yumi"",""Takumi"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
21,0,4,pass,Shunichi,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
22,0,4,talk,George,,"I believe that is a fair summary, Shunichi. I shall continue to observe and think independently. I look forward to seeing what the first night reveals.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
23,0,4,pass,George,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
24,0,4,talk,Yumi,,"I hope we can all sleep well tonight! I'll be thinking hard about how to help everyone tomorrow. Good luck, everyone, and let's find the werewolf together!","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
25,0,4,pass,Yumi,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
26,0,4,talk,Takumi,,"I'm not breaking any character! I'm just the only one actually looking for the bad guy. Sleep tight, everyone, but don't think I'll stop watching you tomorrow!","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
27,0,4,pass,Takumi,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
28,0,4,talk,Jonathan,,I wish you all a peaceful night. I shall reflect on our conversation and await the dawn with a calm heart. Until tomorrow.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
29,0,4,pass,Jonathan,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false,""trailing"":true}"
