36,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,"And we're back. I'm sure the Seer has some interesting news, or perhaps they're playing it safe. @Yumi, you were so eager to help us; do you have anything to share, or are you keeping secrets?","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,1,talk,George,,"Let us not pressure Yumi immediately, Shunichi. If the Seer chooses to reveal their findings, they will do so when they feel it is most beneficial for the village. Patience is a virtue in these matters.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,1,talk,Yumi,,"Actually, I do have something to say! I'm the Seer, and I divined Takumi last night. He is the werewolf! Everyone, please believe me, we have to stop him now!","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,1,talk,Takumi,,"What?! That's a total lie! @Yumi, why are you lying about me? I'm not the werewolf! You're just trying to frame me because I said I'd call out the liars! Everyone, don't listen to her!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,"@Yumi, that is a very bold and direct claim. @Takumi, your reaction is equally intense. Since we have a direct conflict between the Seer's claim and the accused, we must weigh their words carefully.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"Well, this escalated quickly. @Yumi, coming out as the Seer on Day 1 is a high-risk move. Either you're genuinely trying to save us, or you're a very aggressive werewolf trying to eliminate Takumi immediately. What do you think, everyone?","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,2,talk,George,,"It is a bold move, indeed. However, Yumi's personality has been consistently sincere. While a werewolf could mimic that, her willingness to risk herself by revealing her role suggests she truly believes she has found the enemy. @Takumi, your reaction is quite loud.","{""words"":43,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,2,talk,Yumi,,"I'm not lying! I really did divine Takumi, and the result was clear. I know it's a risk to come out now, but I couldn't keep it a secret when I know who the werewolf is! Please, we have to trust me!","{""words"":42,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,2,talk,Takumi,,"@George, don't let her trick you just because she's acting cute! She's just a liar! If she's the Seer, why is she so desperate to get me out right now? She's the werewolf trying to frame me! Everyone, wake up!","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@Yumi, your conviction is strong, and @Takumi, your denial is equally fervent. If Yumi is the Seer, the choice is simple. But if she is the werewolf, she has just handed us the victory. We must consider who benefits more from this chaos.","{""words"":43,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,"@Jonathan, you're playing the middle ground as usual. But let's be rational: if Yumi is the werewolf, she's essentially committed suicide by outing herself. It's a gamble, but a poor one. @Takumi, your desperation is starting to look like guilt.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Jonathan"",""Yumi"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,3,talk,George,,"I agree with Shunichi. Takumi, your aggression is becoming a distraction. While I prefer to be cautious, Yumi's directness is hard to ignore. If she is lying, she has put a target on her own back. Why would she do that?","{""words"":41,""mentions"":[""Shunichi"",""Takumi"",""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,3,talk,Yumi,,"Exactly! I just want to protect everyone! I'm not trying to be ""cute,"" I'm trying to be honest! Please, @Shunichi, @George, @Jonathan, you have to trust me so we can win this together!","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Shunichi"",""George"",""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,3,talk,Takumi,,"I'm not being desperate, I'm being honest! @Shunichi, @George, you're just falling for her act! If she's the werewolf, she's just trying to look like a hero to trick you all! Don't let her win this easily!","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Shunichi"",""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,"@Takumi, your defense is based entirely on the possibility that Yumi is lying, yet you offer no evidence other than her personality. In a game of logic, Yumi's claim is a more actionable piece of information. I am inclined to trust her.","{""words"":42,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,"It's practically a consensus then. @Takumi, your defense is just noise at this point. Logic dictates we follow the Seer's lead unless there's a reason to doubt her, and so far, you're the only one shouting. I'm voting for Takumi.","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,1,4,talk,George,,"I must agree. While I dislike rushing to judgment, the logic is sound. Yumi has risked her position to guide us, and Takumi's reaction has only served to heighten my suspicion. I will vote for Takumi.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Yumi"",""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,1,4,talk,Yumi,,"Thank you, everyone, for believing me! I know it was a big risk to tell you so soon, but I really wanted to save us. Please, let's vote for Takumi so we can be safe!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Takumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,1,4,talk,Takumi,,"This is a nightmare! You're all just blindly following her! @Jonathan, you're supposed to be the smart one, but you're just playing into her hands! If you kill me, you're just helping the real werewolf win! I'm not the werewolf!","{""words"":40,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
55,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,"@Takumi, your frustration is understandable, but it does not change the facts presented. Yumi has provided a clear lead, and your response has been purely emotional. For the sake of the village, I will vote for you.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Takumi"",""Yumi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
